{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51019","headline":"看南山 · 栖白","name":"看南山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抗蜀复临秦，凝岚万古新。\n峭连河汉地，气爽市朝人。\n影里天家桂，光中陆海珍。\n爱山兼恋此，偏柰与谁隣？\n（见《分门纂类唐歌诗》残本第二册《天地山川类》卷二十二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}